free use is conditioned on who you are and, for companies, on revenue
and headcount.

This license modifies PolyForm Small Business License 1.0.0's "Small
Business" section — broadening it to also cover individuals and
non-profits, and fixing the revenue threshold in EUR rather than
indexing it to US inflation data. Because of that modification, it is
**not** the unmodified stock license and should not be referred to by
the SPDX identifier `PolyForm-Small-Business-1.0.0`.

Companies that don't qualify for free use under "Free Use" below need a
commercial license — contact juergen.a.reiss@web.de to obtain one.

