## Free Use

Use of the software is a permitted purpose if any of the following apply:

1. You are using the software for your own personal purposes and not
   for the benefit of any company or organization.

2. You are using the software for the benefit of a non-profit
   organization.

3. You are using the software for the benefit of your company, and
   your company has fewer than 100 total individuals working as
   employees and independent contractors, and less than 5,000,000 EUR
